  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.42 Excess interim CO2 emissions",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.42 “Excess interim CO2 emissions” means tons of CO2 emitted by a CO2 budget source during an interim control period in excess of the CO2 budget emissions limitation for the source, multiplied by 0.50.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.40); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.43)",
